  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice cucumber into thin sticks.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a small bowl, combine the honey and soy sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6438942cb4cbfddc010ee30a/step-1b938ee7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine slaw mix, the mayonnaise and drizzle of vinegar.\n• Season to taste and toss to coat. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6438942cb4cbfddc010ee30a/step-c76ac861.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut Japanese tofu into small cubes.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, turning, until golden on all sides, 5-7 mins.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove from heat and stir in honey-soy mixture.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6438942cb4cbfddc010ee30a/step-21ae30a8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat flour tortillas in microwave for 10 second bursts, until warmed through.\n• Build tacos by topping tortillas with slaw, cucumber and tofu. Sprinkle with crispy shallots and chilli flakes (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6438942cb4cbfddc010ee30a/step-a3088874.jpg"
    }
  ]
